      "message": "fix(ui): orthographic view maps depth to wgpu's 0..1 so the scene draws\n\nThe ortho branch of Camera::mvp used glOrtho's depth row (z -1..1).\nWebGPU clips 0 <= z <= w and ortho clip.w is 1, so every point nearer\nthan (near + far) / 2 - twenty orbit distances out - was clipped and\nthe viewport went blank. Map near..far linearly to 0..1 instead; the\nLess test against the 1.0 clear and the composite's 0..1 frag_depth\ncheck already assume that range.\n\nFixes #600\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAgjpiZbXSvmXLvdmL",
